0012B9  2               ;
0012B9  2               ;	WRITE CHARACTER(A) TO UART
0012B9  2               ;________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
0012B9  2               ;
0012B9  2               WRSER1:
0012B9  2  48                   PHA
0012BA  2               WRSER1a:
