001ABA  3                                               ; OK, Y OFFSET IS IN PTEMPW1, X IS IN PTEMPW
001ABA  3  A9 A0                LDA     #$A0            ; ADD THE MEMORY OFFSET TO PTEMPW (BECAUSE IT IS EASY)
001ABC  3  8D 34 17             STA     PTEMPW+1        ; THEN ADD PTEMPW1 TO PTEMPW THAT SHOULD BE THE MEMORY ADDRESS TO UPDATE
